Error [jet.OperatorTypeMismatch]: Only an optional value can be compared with `None`, but this is String (text)
  --> none_test_non_optional.jet:3:8
    |
  3 |     if s == None {
    |        ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A value whose type isn't optional is never None, so this comparison is always false
 Fix: Remove the comparison, or give the value an optional type such as `String?` if it can be missing
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0109
